  "slides": {
    "slide_0": {
      "group": "Verse 1",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Once to every manand nation,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Comes themoment todecide,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "In the strife of truth with falsehood,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "For thegood or e vil side;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Some great cause, God’s new Messi ah,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Offering each the bloom orblight,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "And the choice goes byforever,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "‘Twixt that darkness and that light.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_1": {
      "group": "Verse 2",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Then to side with truth is noble, when we share her wretched crust,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Ere her cause bring fame and profit, and 'tis prosperous to be just;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Then it is the brave man chooses while the coward stands aside,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Till the multitude make virtue of the faith they had denied.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_2": {
      "group": "Verse 3",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "By the light of burning martyrs, Christ, Thy bleeding feet we track,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Toiling up new Calv'ries ever with the cross that turns not back;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "New occasions teach new duties, time makes ancient good uncouth,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "They must upward still and onward, who would keep abreast of truth.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_3": {
      "group": "Verse 4",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Though the cause of evil prosper, yet the truth alone is strong;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Though her portion be the scaffold, and upon the throne be wrong;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Yet that scaffold sways the future, and behind the dim unknown,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Standeth God within the shadow, keeping watch above His own.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
